    "intro": "Essential Information The Peruvian Amazon is one of the most biodiverse destinations on Earth . From Puerto Maldonado, you […]",
    "content_html": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"essential-information\"> Essential Information</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5e7bd4bb2d66bf54362944cc/900a16dc-dd01-43ca-9665-90c18342466f/baby%2Bcapuchin%2B1.jpg\" alt=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5e7bd4bb2d66bf54362944cc/900a16dc-dd01-43ca-9665-90c18342466f/baby%2Bcapuchin%2B1.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.tierrasvivas.com/img/tambopata-national-reserve-06-1217.jpg\" alt=\"https://www.tierrasvivas.com/img/tambopata-national-reserve-06-1217.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://lirp.cdn-website.com/1de049c2/dms3rep/multi/opt/Lake%2B1920%2Bx%2B1080-640w.png\" alt=\"https://lirp.cdn-website.com/1de049c2/dms3rep/multi/opt/Lake%2B1920%2Bx%2B1080-640w.png\" style=\"width:750px;height:auto\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The <strong><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Peruvian Amazon</a></strong> is one of the most biodiverse destinations on Earth . From <a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Puerto Maldonado</a>, you can access a unique experience surrounded by jungle, rivers, and incredible wildlife.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This destination is perfect for travelers seeking <strong>adventure, nature, and total disconnection</strong>, in an environment completely different from the Andes or the coast of <a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Peru.</a></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"key-facts\"> Key Facts</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li> Location: Madre de Dios Region</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Access: Flights from Lima (approx. 1h 40 min)</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Climate: Tropical humid (77°F – 95°F / 25°C – 35°C)</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Difficulty: Easy – Moderate</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"what-to-do-in-puerto-maldonado\"> What to Do in Puerto Maldonado</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"navigate-the-madre-de-dios-river\"> Navigate the Madre de Dios River</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://peruvian-sunrise.com/sites/default/files/styles/is_vista_peru_travel_packages/public/2024-05/Amazon%20Jungle%20-%20peru.webp?itok=u0HnJ5ZT\" alt=\"https://peruvian-sunrise.com/sites/default/files/styles/is_vista_peru_travel_packages/public/2024-05/Amazon%20Jungle%20-%20peru.webp?itok=u0HnJ5ZT\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cruiseweb.com/_next/image?q=50&amp;url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fports-of-call-nauta-cano-forrest-of-rivers.jpg%3F2025-08-18T16%3A42%3A39.075Z&amp;w=1920\" alt=\"https://cruiseweb.com/_next/image?q=50&amp;url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fports-of-call-nauta-cano-forrest-of-rivers.jpg%3F2025-08-18T16%3A42%3A39.075Z&amp;w=1920\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.pelago.com/img/products/PE-Peru/4-day-amazon-eco-lodge-tour-from-puerto-maldonado/19117b7c-bf38-4159-af90-51c5755ee278_4-day-amazon-eco-lodge-tour-from-puerto-maldonado.jpg\" alt=\"https://www.pelago.com/img/products/PE-Peru/4-day-amazon-eco-lodge-tour-from-puerto-maldonado/19117b7c-bf38-4159-af90-51c5755ee278_4-day-amazon-eco-lodge-tour-from-puerto-maldonado.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Boat transfer to eco-lodges</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Wildlife spotting</a> from the very beginning</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Immersive jungle experience</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"macaw-clay-lick-tambopata\"> Macaw Clay Lick (Tambopata)</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.civitatis.com/f/peru/puerto-maldonado/excursion-colpa-loros-guacamayos-grid.jpg\" alt=\"https://www.civitatis.com/f/peru/puerto-maldonado/excursion-colpa-loros-guacamayos-grid.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.tripspoint.com/uploads/photos/7417/peru-puerto-maldonado-amazon-wildlife-macaw-clay-lick-chuncho-4-days_xVg2R.jpeg\" alt=\"https://cdn.tripspoint.com/uploads/photos/7417/peru-puerto-maldonado-amazon-wildlife-macaw-clay-lick-chuncho-4-days_xVg2R.jpeg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://fieldguides.com/images_hero/prs-Red-and-green-macaw-Peru.jpg\" alt=\"https://fieldguides.com/images_hero/prs-Red-and-green-macaw-Peru.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Spectacular sunrise experience </li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hundreds of macaws and parrots feeding on clay</li>\n\n\n\n<li>One of the most impressive natural shows in Peru</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"lake-sandoval\"> Lake Sandoval</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.getyourguide.com/image/format%3Dauto%2Cfit%3Dcrop%2Cgravity%3Dauto%2Cquality%3D60%2Cwidth%3D350%2Cheight%3D290/tour_img/0cae137c1f08f3a6415f7e0fbb1f4dee945a4205b8d69838efaa828e830ff147.jpg\" alt=\"https://cdn.getyourguide.com/image/format%3Dauto%2Cfit%3Dcrop%2Cgravity%3Dauto%2Cquality%3D60%2Cwidth%3D350%2Cheight%3D290/tour_img/0cae137c1f08f3a6415f7e0fbb1f4dee945a4205b8d69838efaa828e830ff147.jpg\" style=\"width:750px;height:auto\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55f702a4e4b0794fbe24736b/1686590818861-43ATRE1XJWPM95JFZX81/Sandoval%2BLake%2BLodge%2B-%2BSandoval%2BLake%2BGiant%2BRiver%2BOtters.JPG?format=2500w\" alt=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55f702a4e4b0794fbe24736b/1686590818861-43ATRE1XJWPM95JFZX81/Sandoval%2BLake%2BLodge%2B-%2BSandoval%2BLake%2BGiant%2BRiver%2BOtters.JPG?format=2500w\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.tripspoint.com/uploads/photos/7911/peru-puerto-maldonado-amazon-trip-sandoval-lake-3days_0LJTl.jpeg\" alt=\"https://cdn.tripspoint.com/uploads/photos/7911/peru-puerto-maldonado-amazon-trip-sandoval-lake-3days_0LJTl.jpeg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">Jungle hike</a> + canoe ride</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Wildlife spotting:\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Giant river otters </li>\n\n\n\n<li>Monkeys </li>\n\n\n\n<li>Caimans </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"night-jungle-walks\"> Night Jungle Walks</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.tambopatalodge.com/img/amazon-jungle-night-walk-179.jpg\" alt=\"https://www.tambopatalodge.com/img/amazon-jungle-night-walk-179.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.amazonperujungle.com/images/excursions11.jpg\" alt=\"https://www.amazonperujungle.com/images/excursions11.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/1141/4600713624_b992031134_b.jpg\" alt=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/1141/4600713624_b992031134_b.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Explore the jungle at night</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Discover insects, amphibians, and nocturnal life</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Guided by expert naturalists</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"best-time-to-visit\"> Best Time to Visit</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"dry-season-may-october\"> Dry Season (May – October)</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Less rain</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Better trail conditions</li>\n\n\n\n<li>More comfortable excursions</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Ideal for first-time visitors</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"rainy-season-november-april\"> Rainy Season (November – April)</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Greener landscapes </li>\n\n\n\n<li>More active wildlife</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Better river navigation</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> A more immersive and authentic experience</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"best-months-to-travel\"> Best Months to Travel</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> <strong>May, June, September, and October</strong><br> Good weather<br> Better visibility<br> Fewer complications</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"where-to-stay\"> Where to Stay</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li> <strong>Jungle lodges (recommended)</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Full experience</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Includes tours and meals</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Hotels in the city (basic option)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Best option: stay inside the rainforest </p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"important-travel-tips\"> Important Travel Tips</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li> Bring insect repellent (essential)</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Wear light clothing + long sleeves</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Comfortable shoes or boots</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Use sunscreen</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Stay hydrated</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"experience-the-amazon-safely\"> Experience the Amazon Safely</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To fully enjoy your trip, choose operators that include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li> Organized transfers</li>\n\n\n\n<li> River transportation</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Expert guides</li>\n\n\n\n<li> Safe and well-equipped lodges</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"plan-your-adventure\"> Plan Your Adventure</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Exploring the Amazon from Puerto Maldonado is a truly unforgettable experience <br>Pure nature, incredible wildlife, and total disconnection await you.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> <strong>Book with <a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">GT Peru Travel </a>and get ready to experience one of the most amazing adventures in Peru.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> <strong>Contact us: +51 947 831 392</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
